OL,3,GNEWSATalks on Drumcree parading dispute
OL,4,Aend without agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fresh legal bid issued by lawyers for
OL,7,Fthe residents to try to prevent the
OL,8,Fmarch from going ahead was due to be
OL,9,Fheard on Friday - but has been
OL,10,Fpostponed until Monday.
